        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 471333, Art Nouveau Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Art Nouveau movement reached it's hight in the late 1890's and early 1900's. It is characterized by the attention to the forms found in nature, particularly the curved lines of plants and flowers. This Art Nouveau Bronze Handleset has the ability to transport a home back to a simpler time. It's the perfect finishing touch for any restoration project and will add an authentic look to historic homes. This ornate bronze handleset with covered deadbolt is either flat black bronze finish or a medium bronze finish. This Art Nouveau Entrance Handleset is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function. This old world handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Art Nouveau Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Art Nouveau Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Height: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Width: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-471333-specifications.pdf?v=1704262346\"><b>Emtek 471333 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-471333-finish.jpg?v=1704354741\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Art Nouveau Bronze Handleset",
                "description": "The Art Nouveau movement reached it's hight in the late 1890's and early 1900's. It is characterized by the attention to the forms found in nature, particularly the curved lines of plants and flowers. This Art Nouveau Bronze Handleset has the ability to transport a home back to a simpler time. It's the perfect finishing touch for any restoration project and will add an authentic look to historic homes. This ornate bronze handleset with covered deadbolt is either flat black bronze finish or a medium bronze finish. This Art Nouveau Entrance Handleset is available as a dummy function and a single cylinder function. This old world handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Art Nouveau Entry Door Handlesets, Art Nouveau Bronze Handlesets, Emtek 471333, Emtek 472333, Emtek 470333, EMT-471333, old world door pulls, medieval door pulls, castle handlesets, Art Nouveau Entry Door Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, Lost Wax Cast Bronze Art Nouveau Tubular Handlesets, Emtek Art Nouveau Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, plantation home hardware, 18th century hardware,"
